---
// 文件说明：钢铁侠实时姿态同步体验组件，提供全屏 3D 画布、画中画摄像头与状态 HUD。
interface Props {
	labels: {
		statusLoading: string;
		statusTracking: string;
		statusNoPose: string;
		statusCameraDenied: string;
		statusLowFps: string;
		hintStart: string;
		hintCamera: string;
		fpsLabel: string;
		infoTitle: string;
	};
}

const { labels } = Astro.props;
const labelsJson = JSON.stringify(labels);
---

<div class="ironman-app" data-labels={labelsJson}>
	<div id="ironman-info" class="info"></div>
	<canvas id="ironman-canvas"></canvas>
	<div id="ironman-pip" class="pip" title="camera">
		<video id="ironman-video" muted playsinline></video>
		<canvas id="ironman-pip-overlay" class="pip-overlay"></canvas>
	</div>
	<div id="ironman-status" class="status" role="status" data-state="loading">
		<div class="status-line"></div>
		<div class="fps-line"></div>
	</div>
	<div id="ironman-hint" class="hint"></div>
	<div id="ironman-start" class="start-overlay">
		<button id="ironman-start-btn" class="start-btn" type="button"></button>
	</div>
</div>

<script>
	import { initIronManExperience } from '../scripts/ironman/index';

	const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.ironman-app');
	if (root) void initIronManExperience(root);
</script>

<style>
	:global(body main) {
		max-width: 100%;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.ironman-app {
		position: relative;
		height: calc(100vh - 130px);
		min-height: 420px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #111122;
	}
	canvas {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}
	.info {
		position: absolute;
		top: 16px;
		left: 16px;
		z-index: 10;
		padding: 10px 16px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
		border-left: 4px solid #f5c518;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	.pip {
		position: absolute;
		right: 12px;
		bottom: 12px;
		z-index: 5;
		width: 200px;
		height: 150px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
		border-radius: 12px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: width 0.3s, height 0.3s;
		background: #000;
	}
	.pip video {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		transform: scaleX(-1);
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.pip-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 1;
		transform: scaleX(-1);
	}
	.pip.expanded {
		width: 320px;
		height: 240px;
	}
	.status {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 24px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		z-index: 10;
		min-width: 200px;
		padding: 8px 20px;
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
		color: #0f0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-align: center;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.25);
	}
	.status[data-state='noPose'] {
		color: #f5c518;
		border-color: rgba(245, 197, 24, 0.35);
	}
	.status[data-state='denied'],
	.status[data-state='lowFps'] {
		color: #ff6b6b;
		border-color: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.35);
	}
	.status .fps-line {
		margin-top: 4px;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #9fb0e0;
	}
	.hint {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 8px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		z-index: 3;
		max-width: calc(100% - 240px);
		padding: 6px 12px;
		color: #c6cdea;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-align: center;
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	.start-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 6;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background: rgba(4, 5, 12, 0.72);
		backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
	}
	.start-btn {
		padding: 12px 28px;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: #fff;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cc2222, #f5c518);
		border: none;
		border-radius: 999px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.15s;
	}
	.start-btn:hover {
		transform: scale(1.04);
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.pip {
			width: 120px;
			height: 90px;
		}
		.hint {
			max-width: calc(100% - 140px);
			font-size: 0.68rem;
		}
	}
</style>
